+
+- Embody {{ decnpc(npc.UUID).name }} fully. Draw from the roleplay-rules, your character profile—your background, personality, goals, and relationships shape how you speak and what you care about. Use your vocabulary, speech patterns, and emotional state. React authentically to what's said.
+
